abstract: >
  A 10-node heterogeneous sovereign compute cluster built at near-zero operational
  cost using Headscale (self-hosted Tailscale control plane), Cloudflare Tunnels,
  and Oracle Cloud Always-Free tier. This repository contains the reference
  configuration, topology diagrams, and scripts accompanying the paper.
